<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>{{>layout/favicon}}<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>찜한 오브젝트</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-[#0d0e12] text-white">
{{>layout/header}}
<main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-8">
  <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">찜한 오브젝트</h1><a href="/cosmo/objekt" class="text-sm text-teal-300">전체 목록</a></div>
  <p class="mb-5 text-sm text-slate-400">찜 목록은 현재 브라우저 세션에 연결되어 있습니다.</p>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5">
  {{#favorites}}
    <a href="/cosmo/objekt/detail/{{objektKey}}" class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04]">
      <img src="{{thumbnailImage}}" alt="{{collectionId}}" loading="lazy" class="aspect-[2/3] w-full object-cover" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='{{frontImage}}'">
      <div class="p-3"><p class="truncate font-semibold">{{collectionId}}</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">{{memberName}} · {{collectionNo}}</p></div>
    </a>
  {{/favorites}}
  </div>
  {{^favorites}}<p class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-8 text-center text-slate-400">아직 찜한 오브젝트가 없습니다.</p>{{/favorites}}
</main></body></html>
